/// The queue of agent jobs, which runners pull from, as GitHub's runners
/// pull CI jobs. Implemented by Visor's server and by Shireworks' server
/// (its jobs from GitHub issues). Drafted by Shireworks (12 Nov 2026).
///
/// A runner claims a job (a long poll; none when the wait ends), keeps the
/// claim by renewing it before `claim_expires`, and reports how it goes.
/// Its wrapper reports too (Started, Completed, Failed). An unrenewed claim
/// is released: the job goes back to the queue.

